{"seq":1,"slug":"fulfillment-decarbon-lever","title":"履约减排杠杆（模式/路由/包材）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/emission-reduce-offset/fulfillment-decarbon-lever","wordCount":2268,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"履约减排杠杆-模式-路由-包材\">履约减排杠杆（模式/路由/包材）</h1><p>碳足迹算出来之后，几乎所有可执行的减排都发生在履约环节，而且大部分不是靠买设备，是靠改决策。这一篇把跨境履约的减排杠杆按&quot;你能控制什么&quot;分类，给出每条杠杆的量化逻辑，然后用边际减排成本把它们排成一条可以照着执行的曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条减排杠杆要成立，必须同时满足三个条件：<strong>物理上真实</strong>（确实减少的排放量可计量）、<strong>归因明确</strong>（增减发生在你能影响的范围内）、<strong>可复算</strong>（别人拿同样的活动数据能算出同一个差值）。缺第三个，减排声明就无法通过核验。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>杠杆价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>×</mo><mtext>碳价</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>成本</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>与</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>baseline</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>lever</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{杠杆价值} = \\frac{\\Delta E \\times \\text{碳价}}{\\Delta \\text{成本}} \\quad \\text{与} \\quad \\Delta E = E_{\\text{baseline}} - E_{\\text{lever}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">杠杆价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碳价</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">与</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">baseline</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lever</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子减碳量、分母代价，得到的单位是&quot;每减少一吨碳的成本&quot;。负值意味着这条杠杆本身省钱（例如提高装载率通常既减排又降运费），应当是优先执行项。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[履约减排杠杆] --&gt; B[模式切换]&#10;  A --&gt; C[路由与网络]&#10;  A --&gt; D[包装与装载]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[空运转海运]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[公路转铁路]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[尾程电动化]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[海外仓前置]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[干线路径优化]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[合并派送]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[装载率提升]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[包材减重]&#10;  D --&gt; D3[箱型优化]&#10;  D --&gt; D4[循环包装]&#10;  B1 --&gt; E[量化: 强度差 x tkm]&#10;  B2 --&gt; E&#10;  B3 --&gt; F[量化: 能耗 x 电力因子差]&#10;  C3 --&gt; G[量化: 每单排放 x 密度比]&#10;  D1 --&gt; H[量化: 1/装载率 的倒数效应]&#10;  D2 --&gt; I[量化: 减重 x 材料因子]\">graph TD\n  A[履约减排杠杆] --&gt; B[模式切换]\n  A --&gt; C[路由与网络]\n  A --&gt; D[包装与装载]\n  B --&gt; B1[空运转海运]\n  B --&gt; B2[公路转铁路]\n  B --&gt; B3[尾程电动化]\n  C --&gt; C1[海外仓前置]\n  C --&gt; C2[干线路径优化]\n  C --&gt; C3[合并派送]\n  D --&gt; D1[装载率提升]\n  D --&gt; D2[包材减重]\n  D --&gt; D3[箱型优化]\n  D --&gt; D4[循环包装]\n  B1 --&gt; E[量化: 强度差 x tkm]\n  B2 --&gt; E\n  B3 --&gt; F[量化: 能耗 x 电力因子差]\n  C3 --&gt; G[量化: 每单排放 x 密度比]\n  D1 --&gt; H[量化: 1/装载率 的倒数效应]\n  D2 --&gt; I[量化: 减重 x 材料因子]</pre><h2 id=\"模式切换-最大单笔收益-也最贵的代价\">模式切换：最大单笔收益，也最贵的代价</h2><h3 id=\"用库存持有成本做判据\">用库存持有成本做判据</h3><p>模式切换的量化逻辑最直接：<strong>同一批货在两种运输方式下的强度差乘以运输作业量</strong>。由于海运与空运的强度差达两个数量级以上，这条杠杆往往是全链路里单项收益最大的。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>mode</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>sea</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta E_{\\text{mode}} = W \\times D \\times (I_{\\text{air}} - I_{\\text{sea}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">mode</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">air</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sea</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但它的代价不是钱，而是时效。跨境场景里&quot;空运转海运&quot;通常意味着交付期从几天变成几周，这对补货型商品可行，对时效敏感型商品不可行。所以真正可执行的模式切换杠杆不是&quot;全部转海运&quot;，而是<strong>分层</strong>：按商品的需求波动性、毛利、库存持有成本，把可承受长交付期的部分切出来走海运。</p>\n<p>这个分层有一个可量化的判据：<strong>库存持有成本与运输碳成本之和</strong>。空运快、海运慢，慢的那部分需要更多在途库存与安全库存支撑，而仓储占用本身有碳排（见 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-emission-calc/warehousing-packaging-carbon\">仓储与包装环节碳排</a>）。如果慢速运输省下的运输碳被增加的仓储碳吃掉，这条杠杆的净收益就是零甚至为负。这是碳核算里少见的&quot;两个减排手段互相打架&quot;的场合，必须做净额比较而不是各算各的。</p>\n<p>铁路是介于海运与公路之间的选项，强度通常是公路的三分之一到五分之一，时效远好于海运。中欧班列这类走廊的价值正在于此。它的核算要点是电气化率与沿线电力因子的差异——同一条铁路走廊在电气化区段与内燃区段的强度完全不同，不能用单一因子覆盖全程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由与网络-结构性杠杆\">路由与网络：结构性杠杆</h2><h3 id=\"缩短距离与提高密度\">缩短距离与提高密度</h3><p>路由与网络的调整不像模式切换那样有明确的强度差，它的收益来自<strong>缩短距离</strong>与<strong>提高密度</strong>两个机制。</p>\n<p><strong>海外仓前置</strong>缩短的是尾程距离。把库存提前放到离买家更近的节点，尾程从跨洲运输变成同城配送，距离可能从几千公里降到几十公里。代价是库存分散导致的持有成本上升，以及前置仓的备货不当会产生逆向物流。判定条件与模式切换类似：<strong>前置省下的运输碳是否大于分散库存增加的仓储碳</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>干线路径优化</strong>缩短的是首公里与干线距离。这类优化的技术含量在数据而不是算法：你需要一份准确的里程矩阵和一份真实的承运商路由数据。关于干线运力的组织方式，见 <a href=\"../../crossborder-firstmile-linehaul/\">124 跨境首公里与干线运输</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>合并派送</strong>提升的是密度，收益公式在 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-emission-calc/lastmile-fulfillment-carbon\">尾程配送碳排与合并派送</a> 里已经给出：密度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每单排放大致按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n_1 / n_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的比例下降（在下限处不成立，但中等密度区间近似成立）。这条杠杆的工程前提是订单同步能力——要在下单时就识别出&quot;同一收货地址在时间窗内还有别的在途订单&quot;。见 <a href=\"../../order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/\">134 订单智能拆单与多仓履约分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包装与装载-最便宜的一类\">包装与装载：最便宜的一类</h2><h3 id=\"减重必须与破损率绑定\">减重必须与破损率绑定</h3><p>装载率提升的收益来自强度的倒数关系：有效强度等于基础强度除以装载率。装载率从 60% 提到 90%，有效强度下降三分之一。这条杠杆的经济性极好——它同时降低单位运费和单位碳排，<strong>在边际减排成本曲线上通常是负值</strong>（省钱又减碳），所以应该第一顺位执行。</p>\n<p>装载率的上限由两个约束决定：<strong>载重约束与容积约束</strong>，先到先用完。轻抛货（体积大重量小）受容积约束，重货受载重约束。所以提升装载率的手段取决于你的货型：轻抛货要靠箱型优化与堆码方案，重货要靠拼柜与配载算法。</p>\n<p>包材减重的收益是线性的：减掉的重量乘以材料因子。这条杠杆的成本往往为零甚至为负（少用材料就是少花钱），只是需要产品与包装团队配合改设计。有一个需要注意的口径问题：<strong>减重必须在不影响保护性能的前提下成立</strong>，否则破损率上升带来的补发运输排放会超过减重收益。破损率的碳代价可以量化为&quot;补发比例 × 补发运输排放&quot;，通常远大于包装材料本身的隐含碳——这就是为什么&quot;减薄箱子&quot;必须和&quot;破损率监控&quot;绑定实施。</p>\n<p>这两条杠杆是&quot;省钱又减碳&quot;的典型。下表把四类杠杆按 MAC 从低到高排成一条可执行曲线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杠杆</th>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>MAC 量级</th>\n<th>主要约束</th>\n<th>执行顺序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>装载率提升</td>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>负（省钱）</td>\n<td>载重与容积约束</td>\n<td>第一顺位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包材减重</td>\n<td>包装</td>\n<td>负（省钱）</td>\n<td>破损率不得上升</td>\n<td>第一顺位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空运转海运（分层）</td>\n<td>干线运输</td>\n<td>负（省钱）</td>\n<td>在途库存与时效容忍</td>\n<td>谈判优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾程电动化</td>\n<td>尾程</td>\n<td>正（需投入）</td>\n<td>充电设施与电网因子</td>\n<td>择区执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向物流减少</td>\n<td>逆向</td>\n<td>正</td>\n<td>依赖质检与翻新能力</td>\n<td>中期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>永久性移除抵消</td>\n<td>全链路</td>\n<td>高（纯支出）</td>\n<td>只在减排减不动时</td>\n<td>最后手段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decarbon_levers&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;L1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;装载率提升 60%-&gt;90%&quot;,&#10;      &quot;stage&quot;: &quot;distribution&quot;,&#10;      &quot;delta_kg_co2e_per_tkm&quot;: -0.018,&#10;      &quot;delta_cost_per_tkm&quot;: -0.0042,&#10;      &quot;mac_per_tco2e&quot;: -233.3,&#10;      &quot;status&quot;: &quot;priority&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;     